<title>GERMANY: Frankfurt air cargo up 2.5pct in Jan-Oct.</title>
<headline>Frankfurt air cargo up 2.5pct in Jan-Oct.</headline>
<dateline>FRANKFURT 1996-11-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Air cargo handled at Frankfurt airport has risen 2.5 percent over the first ten months of 1996, airport authority figures showed.</p>
<p>All figures are in tonnes with percentage changes on the same period 12 months ago.</p>
<p>		   Total cargo</p>
<p>		   Cumulative total    Pct change</p>
<p> Jan		  95,458		    -2.4</p>
<p> Jan-Feb	   201,164		    +0.1</p>
<p> Jan-March	 321,879		    +0.1</p>
<p> Jan-April	 432,966		    +0.1</p>
<p> Jan-May	   543,403		    +1.2</p>
<p> Jan-June	  655,453		    +1.6</p>
<p> Jan-July	  768,268		    +1.5</p>
<p> Jan-Aug	   878,422		    +1.9</p>
<p> Jan-Sept	  995,317		    +2.2</p>
<p> Jan-Oct	 1,121,176		    +2.5</p>
<p>Cargo by export, import, transit</p>
<p>	     Export     Pct     Import    Pct     Transit Pct</p>
<p> Jan	  49,467   -1.4    43,755   -3.0	2,236   -9.5</p>
<p> Jan-Feb   104,055   -0.3    92,307   +1.0	4,801   -4.9</p>
<p> Jan-Mar   166,530   +0.4   148,027    0.0	7,322   -6.7</p>
<p> Jan-Apr   224,555   +1.0   198,842   -0.4	9,569   -8.0</p>
<p> Jan-May   283,016   +2.2   248,685   +0.8     11,702  -10.7</p>
<p> Jan-Jun   344,531   +3.2   297,164   +0.6     13,758  -12.8</p>
<p> Jan-July  407,156   +3.0   345,201   +0.5     15,912  -12.6</p>
<p> Jan-Aug   466,527   +3.5   393,905   +0.7     17,990  -11.4</p>
<p> Jan-Sept  527,600   +3.8   447,358   +1.1     20,359  -10.9</p>
<p> Jan-Oct   595,201   +4.0   503,130   +1.4     22,845  -10.5</p>
<p>Source: Flughafen Frankfurt Main AG, market research department. - Air Cargo Newsroom Tel+44 171 542 7706 Fax+44 171 542 5017</p>
